    "title": "GaLuxy Photo captures moments in Hartley and beyond - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kaylee Bandstra kbandstra@iowainformation.com ,\n8 hours ago HARTLEY—Laura Lux captures “out of this world” photos as photographer and owner of GaLuxy Photo based in Hartley. “It was kind of cheesy to begin with, honestly,” Lux said about her decision on the name for her photography business. “We were like ‘Oh, we’re out of this world.’ For ‘galaxy,’ I did a play off my last name, which is Lux. So instead of the typical spelling of ‘galaxy’ with an ‘a,’ I did ‘GaLuxy’ with an L-U-X in there.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
    "summary": "By Kaylee Bandstra kbandstra@iowainformation.com , 8 hours ago HARTLEY—Laura Lux captures “out of this world” photos as photographer and owner of GaLuxy Photo based in Hartley. “It was kind of cheesy to begin with, honestly,” Lux said about her decision on the name for her photography business. “We were like ‘Oh, we’re out of this world.’ For ‘galaxy,’ I did a play off my last name, which is Lux. So instead of the typical spelling of ‘galaxy’ with an ‘a,’ I did ‘GaLuxy’ with an L-U-X in there.” Read full article",
